<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS -MARCH 13.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS -MARCH 13.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Polish Thursday kerb bond trade amounted to 5.3 million zlotys with 53,000 variable-interest one-year bonds due March 4, 1998 traded at 98.1 zlotys, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
